     "excerpt": "Final version 38 meets our stated red lines: per-model test results reach customers, and suppression begins 36 months after adoption. S5 uses 8/100,000 for regulator review and allows a recall for unacceptable risk or failure to mitigate, rather than automatically—consistent with the CEO’s direction. S2 sets 7% as the maximum, not the 5% threshold under discussion; that is a policy tradeoff, but does not violate our listed red lines.",
